  "body": "Brand new and finished with real attention to detail, this Torbay townhouse is made for families who want quality and style without the upkeep.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is all about easy living. Warm timber-look floors run throughout, and a fluted timber feature wall adds texture to the lounge. Architectural track lighting and well-placed glazing keep the space light and inviting. The kitchen is the standout. It’s a designer space with rich timber cabinetry and LED under-lighting, a curved stone-look island with a fluted base, brass tapware, textured tiling and quality appliances. There’s plenty of storage, plus a lit glass display cabinet for entertaining. Dining sits between the kitchen and lounge and opens straight outside, so weeknight dinners and weekend catch-ups move easily between indoors and out.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms offer a quiet retreat, with soft carpet, feature cove lighting and pendant bedside lights. Two full bathrooms plus a downstairs guest powder room keep busy mornings running smoothly.\r\n\r\nPractical touches make daily life simple. There’s a heat pump for year-round comfort, a built-in sound system and a smart video intercom. The single garage has internal access and is pre-wired for an EV. Because it’s brand new and low-maintenance, you get more time to enjoy what Torbay does best, with local schools, village shops, parks and beaches all close by.\r\n\r\nA 10-year Stamford building warranty is included, so you can buy new with confidence.\r\n\r\nAt a glance\r\n\r\n• Brand-new, high-spec, low-maintenance townhouse\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms plus guest powder room\r\n• Designer timber kitchen with fluted island, LED lighting and brass fittings\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Fluted timber feature wall, track lighting and heat pump\r\n• Built-in sound system and smart video intercom\r\n• Single garage with internal access, EV pre-wired\r\n• 10-year Stamford building warranty\r\n• Close to Northcross Intermediate, Glamorgan School and Long Bay College, plus shops, parks and beaches.\r\n\r\nNew homes of this quality in Torbay don’t come along often. Be at the first open home.",
